# PRABAS starter dish catalogue. One dish per line; columns separated by "|", lists by ",".
# After editing, run `npm run catalog` and commit.
#
# type: tiffin, variety_rice, kuzhambu, sambar, rasam, poriyal, kootu, chutney,
#   nonveg_gravy, nonveg_fry, drink, snack
# meals: breakfast, lunch, dinner. tags: protein, fibre, greens, millet, fish, legume, curd.
# sides: dish keys, best first.
# ingredients: item_key:quantity, FOR FIVE PEOPLE, in the item's stored unit (g, ml, or a
#   count: pieces, bunches, packets). A trailing ? marks an optional one. Salt, mustard
#   seeds, turmeric and asafoetida are left out: they're in almost everything.
# Veg or non-veg is worked out from the ingredients (meat, fish or egg makes it non-veg).
#
key|name_ta|name_en|type|meals|tags|sides|ingredients|aliases

